WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
Two nearly identical tones go to separate ears. You may hear a third rhythm even though none was played into the room.

00:07.000 --> 00:14.000
The beat is a real perception. But perception isn't the same thing as improved performance.

00:14.000 --> 00:21.000
A 2023 review found contradictory EEG results across fourteen studies. The stimulus matters.

00:21.000 --> 00:28.000
A 2025 experiment found a narrow attention effect, but not an end to vigilance decline.

00:28.000 --> 00:35.000
Before paying for any meditation MP3, try twelve quiet minutes on one real task and note what you finish.

00:35.000 --> 00:42.000
The full source trail is here. Zen12 is optional. Its advertised benefits remain seller claims, not our verdict.
